      "side": 1,
      "message": "CONFIG_PHY_PACKAGE is a hidden config option (no prompt) that cannot be directly enabled in defconfig. It\u0027s only selected by specific PHY drivers.\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android17-6.18/drivers/net/phy/Kconfig#33\n\nI think this patch is a reasonable approach with minimal impact. Are there any better alternatives you would suggest?",
